        "y": 6
      },
      "description": "Latest highway lateral-acceleration standard deviation (g), the looseness proxy. Rising values indicate increased vibration or play. (The steering-offset stat was removed: SteeringAngle is not a Fleet Telemetry field.)",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
